{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-tm-heavy-atom-examples-table3-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:tm-heavy-atom-examples-table3-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table 3 from tm-heavy-atom-examples","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tm-heavy-atom-examples"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"tm-heavy-atom-examples-table3-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"tbl:tm-heavy-atom-examples-table3-data\"></a>\n<strong>Table.</strong> <em>Data table 3 from tm-heavy-atom-examples</em></p>\n<p>Per-generator volume profile for the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">{}^{14}\\mathrm{C} \\to {}^{14}\\mathrm{N}</code> decay. For each braid generator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_i</code>: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k_i</code> is its chiral degree (the number of crossings that change type), <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_i({}^{14}\\mathrm{C})</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_i({}^{14}\\mathrm{N})</code> are the parent and daughter generator volumes, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Delta V_i = V_i({}^{14}\\mathrm{N}) - V_i({}^{14}\\mathrm{C})</code> is that generator's contribution to the energy change. The converting neutron's own generator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_6</code> carries the dominant asymmetry (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{-1.660}</code>, nearly half of the total <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-3.361</code>) that drives the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">{}^{14}\\mathrm{C} \\to {}^{14}\\mathrm{N}</code> difference, while the downstream generators <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_7</code>–<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_{12}</code> are unaffected.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">Generator</th>\n<th align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k_i</code></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_i({}^{14}\\mathrm{C})</code></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_i({}^{14}\\mathrm{N})</code></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Delta V_i</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_0</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">13</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5.970</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5.616</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-0.354</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">12</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5.485</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5.150</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-0.335</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_2</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">11</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4.823</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4.540</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-0.283</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_3</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">10</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4.476</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4.201</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-0.275</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_4</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">9</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3.887</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3.661</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-0.226</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_5</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">8</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3.664</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3.436</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-0.228</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_6</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">7</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4.603</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2.943</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{-1.660}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_7</code>--<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_{12}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">6--1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">identical</td>\n<td align=\"center\">identical</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"}
